 m("This puzzle is ___ harder than the last one.", "considerably", ["very", "too", "so"], "Considerably/far/much + comparative. Example: far better, much bigger.", ["Very doesn't go before comparatives.", "Too doesn't go before comparatives with than.", "So doesn't go before comparatives with than."]),
