 m("He's thinking ___ joining the robotics club.", "about", ["to", "on", "for"], "Think about/of + -ing. Example: I'm thinking of learning Japanese.", ["Think to isn't used here.", "Think on is old-fashioned.", "Think for isn't used here."]),
